gb48(){return"Submit a Leave Request"},
gb47(){return"This is the Leave Request button. Tap it to open the leave submission form."},
gb46(){return"Your Balances"},
gb45(){return"Your leave balances at a glance. 'Available Now' is what you can use today (it can go negative if you're in deficit). Carry-forward days are last year's remainder and expire on Mar 31; overtime/compensation balance is shown separately and is used before annual leave."},
gb4c(){return"Start Date"},
gb4b(){return"Pick the first day of your leave. In the calendar, days struck through in red are unavailable \u2014 they already have a leave, business-trip, or missing-punch request. Tap a red day to see the reason."},
gb4i(){return"End Date"},
gb4h(){return"Pick the last day of your leave. The range can't cross an unavailable (red) day, so the selectable days adjust automatically based on your start date."},
gb4e(){return"Partial Hours"},
gb4d(){return"Only shown for a single-day request. Choose how many hours you need instead of a full day \u2014 leave it empty to take the whole day. Selecting hours limits which leave types you can pick."},
gb4a(){return"Days Off"},
gb49(){return"A live count of how long you'll be off for the dates you chose. It shows hours instead of days when you request partial hours."},
gb4k(){return"Leave Type"},
gb4j(){return"Choose the type that fits your situation. A greyed-out option means its rule isn't met for your current dates, hours, or balance.\n\n\u2022 Annual \u2014 planned time off. Needs available or carry-forward balance, is subject to your yearly allowance. If you have overtime balance, use Compensation first.\n\n\u2022 Emergency \u2014 sudden, same-day needs. Limited to one day and requires available annual/carry-forward balance.\n\n\u2022 Compensation \u2014 spends your overtime balance. Available only when that balance covers the requested days.\n\n\u2022 Sick \u2014 for illness. Requires uploading a sick note.\n\n\u2022 Unpaid \u2014 time off without pay. Available only when you have little or no paid balance left."},
gb4g(){return"Submit"},
gb4f(){return"Sends your request for approval. It stays grey and disabled until every field is valid, then turns blue. Any blocking issue (like an emergency request that's too long) is shown just above this button."},
